Changelog: 28-11-2026 13:50:08

Release 4.9.3.

Changelog: 27-11-2026 19:44:37

Release 4.9.2.

Changelog: 27-11-2026 18:49:04

Fixed. The GPU row shows the average load of the last second. Before, it showed one snapshot per second, and the
number dropped to 0 % now and then while the GPU was under full load. The governor counts the load over 16 ms, about
one frame, so a single reading can fall between two frames.

