Release 2.1.0.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 04:09:59

Breaking. BC-250 System Overlay has its own id, bc250-system-overlay, for the launcher, the menu entry, the settings
and the data folders (owner, 15-11-2026). It does not take over a copy installed before: uninstall that one first.
